# Finyl-DCP frontend build-time environment (Vite).
# Copy to frontend/.env (or set in your build/host env) and adjust as needed.
#
# VITE_API_URL — base URL of the backend API the SPA calls.
#   • Leave EMPTY for a same-origin deployment (Docker/nginx serves the SPA and
#     proxies /api to the backend). This is the default and needs no config.
#   • Set to the backend's PUBLIC URL for a SPLIT deployment where the frontend is
#     hosted separately (e.g. Netlify) from the backend. No trailing slash.
#     Example: VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
#   NOTE: this is baked in at build time, so rebuild the frontend after changing it,
#   and make sure the backend's ALLOWED_ORIGINS includes this site's origin.
VITE_API_URL=
